WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.800
Send an invitation by email with the right role; the person sets their own password.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:14.660
Users & permissions lists everyone with an account, their role and when they last signed in.

3
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.740
At the top: invitations waiting, temporary access, locked and dormant accounts.

4
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.150
Choose Invite someone.

5
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:29.470
Enter their work email and, if you like, their name.

6
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:41.710
Pick the role. It decides what they can see and do; the guide on the right explains each role.

7
00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:45.510
Choose the language of the invitation email.

8
00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:51.570
Send the invitation. The link works once and expires after a week.

9
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:57.840
You can resend or cancel an invitation from the Invitations tab until it is used.
